<</E(Furthermore, for international students, factors such as English-language accessibility and overall international friendliness are particularly important. In these areas, it is not uncommon for Tier 2 or Tier 3 universities to outperform institutions in higher tiers. For instance, all courses at UNIST are offered in English, whereas most undergraduate programs at Yonsei are taught primarily in Korean.)/K[ 13]/P 140 0 R /Pg 17 0 R /S/P/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
269 0 obj
<</E(We cannot neglect financial considerations either. Some universities in lower tiers offer significantly more generous scholarship packages than their higher-ranked counterparts, making them a more attractive option for many students.)/K[ 14]/P 140 0 R /Pg 17 0 R /S/P/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
