<</E(My name is Keumoe Fozeu Richy. I went to South Korea to study Mathematical Sciences at the Korea Advanced Institute of Science and Technology \(KAIST\) with a 100% scholarship. After personally navigating the Korean university and scholarship landscape, and after supporting several students in their applications, I created this guide to help Cameroonian students discover and pursue higher-education opportunities in South Korea.)/K[ 1]/P 154 0 R /Pg 31 0 R /S/P/Type/StructElem>>
endobj
